@base = http://127.0.0.1:PUERTO

### Authenticate
# @name login
POST {{base}}/auth
Content-Type: application/json

{ "email": "ana@acme.dev", "password": "{{password}}" }

### Fetch the current user (login runs on its own)
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

